:15,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"15:59","t":"Except the family of Lot; indeed, we will save them all","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"15:60","t":"Except his wife.\" We [i.e., Allāh] decreed that she is of those who remain behind.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"15:61","t":"And when the messengers came to the family of Lot,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":61,"sd":null},{"k":"15:62","t":"He said, \"Indeed, you are people unknown.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"15:63","t":"They said, \"But we have come to you with that about which they were disputing,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"15:64","t":"And we have come to you with truth, and indeed, we are truthful.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"15:65","t":"So set out with your family during a portion of the night and follow behind them and let not anyone among you look back and continue on to where you are commanded.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"15:66","t":"And We conveyed to him [the decree] of that matter: that those [sinners] would be eliminated by early morning.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"15:67","t":"And the people of the city came rejoicing.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"15:68","t":"[Lot] said, \"Indeed, these are my guests, so do not shame me.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"15:69","t":"And fear Allāh and do not disgrace me.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"15:70","t":"They said, \"Have we not forbidden you from [protecting] people?\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":70,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[15],"sajdah":false}